#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:4 6ba33b149abc4eb5a96659924fe45aa1
msgid "文件传输"
msgstr "File Transfer"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:7 06b5bf6e79d744d68f1f61c07a0b479f
msgid "用户数据存储空间"
msgstr "User Data Storage Space"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:11 946bba0ff87d427c87e9b32ab38173a4
msgid ""
"在cnSRC上，系统根据三种 :ref:`usage-mode-ref` 为用户在共享文件系统上分配三种目录，分别是个人目录，项目目录和公共集群目录。"
msgstr ""
"On cnSRC, the system allocates three directories on the shared file system "
"according to the three :ref:`usage-mode-ref` usage modes: personal "
"directory, project directory, and public cluster directory."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:13 f1ed7bfe88b74a7f85760a3e0907b916
msgid "在实例或集群中，这三种目录所对应的路径不同，具体见下表："
msgstr ""
"In the instance or cluster, the paths corresponding to these three "
"directories are different, as shown in the following table:"

