msgid "username请替换为自己的用户名（这个信息可以在“我的信息”-“基本信息”中查询）。"
msgstr ""
"change username to your own username (this information can be found in \"my "
"information\"-\"basic information\")."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:29 65d2054e21e9440382f5bde066c4fe87
msgid "<project id>请替换为\"g+项目ID\"（项目基本信息中查询项目ID），例：项目ID为700008，则替换为“g700008”。"
msgstr ""
"change <project id> to \"g+project id\" (project id can be found in project "
"basic information), for example: if project id is 700008, then change it to "
"\"g700008\"."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:31 c95a8d20396743058818364321d4cb48
msgid "<project>请替换为项目名（项目基本信息中查询。）"
msgstr ""
"change <project> to project name (can be found in project basic "
"information)."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:35 40594d021d6b4a00a7a058966386f5c1
msgid "项目目录和公共集群目录的具体说明请分别查看 :ref:`project-data` 。"
msgstr ""
"See :ref:`project-data` for details on the project directory and public "
"cluster directory."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:39 b2e7be0cb29f4afb81add90e6913f550
msgid "Web页面数据传输"
msgstr "web page data transfer"

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:41 cf96780a9b4144499b2627178c50070f
msgid "cnSRC支持通过Web页面上传下载数据和管理文件。"
msgstr ""
"cnSRC supports uploading and downloading data and managing files through the"
" web interface."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:43 aae943aa42e94e1da72e5edf66d2b497
msgid "通过Web页面上传和下载文件有数量限制，每次最多上传\\ **10**\\ 个文件，下载\\ **1**\\ 个文件。"
msgstr ""
"there are quantity limits for uploading and downloading files through web "
"pages, at most **10** files can be uploaded each time, and **1** file can be"
" downloaded."

#: ../../docs/data/transfer.rst:45 631b2a734af7401fa96e2608af208398
msgid "进入“工作台”-“数据总览”，选择相应的数据位置，就可以对个人、项目和公共集群中的数据进行管理。"
msgstr ""
"Enter \"workbench\"-\"data overview\", select the corresponding data "
"location, and then you can manage the data in personal, project and public "
"cluster."

